{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline-design-patterns","title":"流水线设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-design-patterns","wordCount":1068,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"流水线设计模式\">流水线设计模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一条 CI/CD 流水线由<strong>源码管理 → 构建 → 测试 → 安全扫描 → 制品发布 → 部署</strong>六个自动化阶段组成。围绕它有三个设计决策：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分支策略</strong>：GitHub Flow、GitFlow、Trunk-Based 等模型决定代码从开发到生产的流转方式与发布频率。</li>\n<li><strong>触发机制</strong>：<code>push</code>、<code>pull_request</code>、<code>schedule</code>、手动触发等决定流水线何时启动。</li>\n<li><strong>质量门禁</strong>：只有通过全部检查（格式化、类型、测试、安全）的代码才能进入下一阶段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心原则是<strong>快速失败</strong>——把轻量、易发现的检查前置，把耗时任务后置，缩短开发者反馈回路。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-核心阶段\">CI/CD 核心阶段</h2><p>一条完整的 CI/CD 流水线通常由源码管理、构建、测试、安全扫描、制品发布和部署六个核心阶段组成。每个阶段都应该是自动化的、可重复的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    SRC[源码提交] --&gt; BUILD[构建]&#10;    BUILD --&gt; TEST[测试]&#10;    TEST --&gt; SCAN[安全扫描]&#10;    SCAN --&gt; ARTIFACT[制品发布]&#10;    ARTIFACT --&gt; DEPLOY[部署]&#10;    DEPLOY --&gt; MONITOR[监控验证]\">graph LR\n    SRC[源码提交] --&gt; BUILD[构建]\n    BUILD --&gt; TEST[测试]\n    TEST --&gt; SCAN[安全扫描]\n    SCAN --&gt; ARTIFACT[制品发布]\n    ARTIFACT --&gt; DEPLOY[部署]\n    DEPLOY --&gt; MONITOR[监控验证]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>主要活动</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源码管理</td>\n<td>代码提交、分支策略、代码审查</td>\n<td>PR 合并周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建</td>\n<td>编译、打包、镜像构建</td>\n<td>构建时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td>单元测试、集成测试、E2E 测试</td>\n<td>测试覆盖率、通过率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全扫描</td>\n<td>依赖漏洞、镜像安全、SAST</td>\n<td>漏洞数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>制品发布</td>\n<td>镜像推送、包发布、版本标记</td>\n<td>制品大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署</td>\n<td>环境部署、冒烟测试、流量切换</td>\n<td>部署时间、回滚率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git push origin feature/new-api\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/new-api</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 流水线的核心原则是&quot;快速失败&quot;（Fail Fast）。将速度最快、最容易发现问题的检查（如代码格式化、类型检查）放在最前面，耗时较长的测试（如 E2E 测试）放在后面，减少开发者等待时间。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分支策略\">分支策略</h2><p>分支策略决定了代码如何从开发流转到生产。选择合适的分支模型对 CI/CD 的效率至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;init&quot;&#10;    branch develop&#10;    checkout develop&#10;    commit id: &quot;feature-1&quot;&#10;    branch feature/auth&#10;    checkout feature/auth&#10;    commit id: &quot;impl auth&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;add tests&quot;&#10;    checkout develop&#10;    merge feature/auth&#10;    checkout main&#10;    merge develop tag: &quot;v1.0.0&quot;&#10;    checkout develop&#10;    commit id: &quot;feature-2&quot;\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"init\"\n    branch develop\n    checkout develop\n    commit id: \"feature-1\"\n    branch feature/auth\n    checkout feature/auth\n    commit id: \"impl auth\"\n    commit id: \"add tests\"\n    checkout develop\n    merge feature/auth\n    checkout main\n    merge develop tag: \"v1.0.0\"\n    checkout develop\n    commit id: \"feature-2\"</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分支模型</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>发布频率</th>\n<th>适用团队</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub Flow</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>小团队、SaaS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitFlow</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大团队、版本发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trunk-Based</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高级团队、持续部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Release Flow</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大型项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"github-flow\">GitHub Flow</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git checkout -b feature/user-auth&#10;git push origin feature/user-auth&#10;&#10;gh pr create --title &quot;Add user auth&quot; --base main&#10;&#10;git checkout main &amp;&amp; git pull\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/user-auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/user-auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --title</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Add user auth\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --base</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"trunk-based-development\">Trunk-Based Development</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git checkout main&#10;git pull --rebase&#10;git checkout -b short-lived/auth&#10;git push origin short-lived/auth\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rebase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> short-lived/auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> short-lived/auth</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"触发机制\">触发机制</h2><p>流水线触发机制决定了何时以及如何启动自动化流程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;    paths-ignore:&#10;      - &#39;**.md&#39;&#10;      - &#39;docs/**&#39;&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  schedule:&#10;    - cron: &#39;0 2 * * 1&#39;&#10;  workflow_dispatch:&#10;    inputs:&#10;      environment:&#10;        type: choice&#10;        options: [staging, production]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths-ignore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'**.md'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docs/**'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cron</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0 2 * * 1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  workflow_dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    inputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">choice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">staging</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发类型</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>push</td>\n<td>代码推送到指定分支</td>\n<td>main, release/*</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pull_request</td>\n<td>PR 创建/更新</td>\n<td>代码审查前的自动检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>schedule</td>\n<td>定时触发</td>\n<td>每周安全扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workflow_dispatch</td>\n<td>手动触发</td>\n<td>手动部署到生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>release</td>\n<td>发布 Release</td>\n<td>版本发布构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tag</td>\n<td>推送标签</td>\n<td>语义化版本发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;触发 → 流水线映射&quot;&#10;        PUSH[push main] --&gt; FULL[完整 CI/CD]&#10;        PR[pull_request] --&gt; CHECK[CI 检查]&#10;        TAG[push tag v*] --&gt; RELEASE[发布流水线]&#10;        MANUAL[手动触发] --&gt; DEPLOY[部署流水线]&#10;        CRON[定时] --&gt; SCAN[安全扫描]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"触发 → 流水线映射\"\n        PUSH[push main] --&gt; FULL[完整 CI/CD]\n        PR[pull_request] --&gt; CHECK[CI 检查]\n        TAG[push tag v*] --&gt; RELEASE[发布流水线]\n        MANUAL[手动触发] --&gt; DEPLOY[部署流水线]\n        CRON[定时] --&gt; SCAN[安全扫描]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"流水线优化\">流水线优化</h2><p>流水线执行速度直接影响开发者体验和交付效率。优化策略从并行化、缓存和增量构建三个维度展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"并行化\">并行化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  lint:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: npm run lint&#10;&#10;  typecheck:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: npm run typecheck&#10;&#10;  unit-test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: npm test&#10;&#10;  build:&#10;    needs: [lint, typecheck, unit-test]&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: npm run build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  typecheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  unit-test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">typecheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unit-test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run build</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    START[开始] --&gt; LINT[Lint]&#10;    START --&gt; TYPE[类型检查]&#10;    START --&gt; TEST[单元测试]&#10;    LINT --&gt; BUILD[构建]&#10;    TYPE --&gt; BUILD&#10;    TEST --&gt; BUILD&#10;    BUILD --&gt; DEPLOY[部署]\">graph TD\n    START[开始] --&gt; LINT[Lint]\n    START --&gt; TYPE[类型检查]\n    START --&gt; TEST[单元测试]\n    LINT --&gt; BUILD[构建]\n    TYPE --&gt; BUILD\n    TEST --&gt; BUILD\n    BUILD --&gt; DEPLOY[部署]</pre><h3 id=\"缓存策略\">缓存策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    path: ~/.pnpm-store&#10;    key: pnpm-${{ hashFiles(&#39;pnpm-lock.yaml&#39;) }}&#10;    restore-keys: pnpm-\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">~/.pnpm-store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm-${{ hashFiles('pnpm-lock.yaml') }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restore-keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm-</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实施难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作业并行化</td>\n<td>总时间降至最长作业</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖缓存</td>\n<td>减少安装时间 80%+</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker 层缓存</td>\n<td>减少构建时间 60%+</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量测试</td>\n<td>只运行变更相关测试</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自托管 Runner</td>\n<td>消除排队等待</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 CI 中使用 <code>pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</code> 而非 <code>pnpm install</code>。<code>--frozen-lockfile</code> 确保安装的依赖与锁文件完全一致，如果不一致则直接报错，避免 CI 环境中出现与开发环境不同的依赖版本。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"质量门禁\">质量门禁</h2><p>质量门禁（Quality Gate）是流水线中的检查点，只有通过所有检查的代码才能进入下一阶段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  quality-gate:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - name: lint&#10;        run: npm run lint&#10;&#10;      - name: typecheck&#10;        run: npm run typecheck&#10;&#10;      - name: test with coverage&#10;        run: npm test -- --coverage&#10;&#10;      - name: check coverage threshold&#10;        run: |&#10;          COVERAGE=$(cat coverage/coverage-summary.json | jq &#39;.total.lines.pct&#39;)&#10;          if (( $(echo &quot;$COVERAGE &lt; 80&quot; | bc -l) )); then&#10;            echo &quot;Coverage $COVERAGE% is below 80% threshold&quot;&#10;            exit 1&#10;          fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  quality-gate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test with coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm test -- --coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">check coverage threshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          COVERAGE=$(cat coverage/coverage-summary.json | jq '.total.lines.pct')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          if (( $(echo \"$COVERAGE &#x3C; 80\" | bc -l) )); then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            echo \"Coverage $COVERAGE% is below 80% threshold\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            exit 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          fi</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质量门禁</th>\n<th>阈值建议</th>\n<th>阻断级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码格式化</td>\n<td>无格式错误</td>\n<td>必须通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>零类型错误</td>\n<td>必须通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>100% 通过</td>\n<td>必须通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试覆盖率</td>\n<td>≥ 80%</td>\n<td>建议通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全漏洞</td>\n<td>无高危/严重漏洞</td>\n<td>必须通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖许可证</td>\n<td>无不兼容许可</td>\n<td>建议通过</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((流水线设计模式))&#10;    核心阶段&#10;      构建&#10;      测试&#10;      安全扫描&#10;      制品发布&#10;      部署&#10;    分支策略&#10;      GitHub Flow&#10;      Trunk-Based&#10;      GitFlow&#10;    触发机制&#10;      push / PR&#10;      schedule&#10;      手动触发&#10;    优化策略&#10;      并行化&#10;      依赖缓存&#10;      增量构建&#10;    质量门禁&#10;      格式化&#10;      类型检查&#10;      测试覆盖率&#10;      安全扫描\">mindmap\n  root((流水线设计模式))\n    核心阶段\n      构建\n      测试\n      安全扫描\n      制品发布\n      部署\n    分支策略\n      GitHub Flow\n      Trunk-Based\n      GitFlow\n    触发机制\n      push / PR\n      schedule\n      手动触发\n    优化策略\n      并行化\n      依赖缓存\n      增量构建\n    质量门禁\n      格式化\n      类型检查\n      测试覆盖率\n      安全扫描</pre><ul>\n<li>CI/CD 流水线包含构建、测试、安全扫描、制品发布和部署六个核心阶段。</li>\n<li><strong>Trunk-Based Development</strong> 适合高频交付团队，<strong>GitHub Flow</strong> 是小团队的平衡选择。</li>\n<li>遵循&quot;快速失败&quot;原则，将轻量检查前置，耗时任务后置。</li>\n<li>通过作业并行化和依赖缓存可以将流水线时间缩短 60% 以上。</li>\n<li>质量门禁确保只有通过所有检查的代码才能合并和部署。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流水线设计模式","id":"流水线设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 核心阶段","id":"ci-cd-核心阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"分支策略","id":"分支策略"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub Flow","id":"github-flow"},{"level":3,"text":"Trunk-Based Development","id":"trunk-based-development"},{"level":2,"text":"触发机制","id":"触发机制"},{"level":2,"text":"流水线优化","id":"流水线优化"},{"level":3,"text":"并行化","id":"并行化"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存策略","id":"缓存策略"},{"level":2,"text":"质量门禁","id":"质量门禁"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ConfigMap 与 Secret","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/configmaps-and-secrets"},"next":{"title":"GitHub Actions 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions-deep-dive"}}